  "details": "It would be really handy to be able to turn off or on certain items in worlds for just the player and no one else. Notably if you aren't using them at the moment or if they are causing you to lag. For instance toggles to turn off or on all mirrors, chairs, video players, pickupable items, pens, and/or avatar pedestals in a world. \nI for one would get a much needed boast in fps if I could turn off and on mirrors or video players in some worlds.",
